      "side": 1,
      "message": "The bundled database is only copied when the app\u0027s copy is missing or empty, so if xiaomi_ir.sqlite is ever regenerated, existing installs keep the old copy. The asset already has PRAGMA user_version \u003d 1, so comparing versions would let an updated asset replace it:\n\n```\n/** PRAGMA user_version of the bundled asset; bump both when the asset changes. */\nprivate const val DATABASE_VERSION \u003d 1\n...\nval installedVersion \u003d /* open read-only */ db.use { if (populated) it.version else 0 }\nif (installedVersion \u003e\u003d DATABASE_VERSION) return\n```\n\n(and pass DATABASE_VERSION to SQLiteOpenHelper instead of 1)",
