      "writtenOn": "2026-11-01T12:37:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "runCatching also catches CancellationException. When \"No\" is pressed or another code set is picked while one is still being written, tryCodeSet() cancels the previous job, but that job then goes through onFailure: it clears remoteAddress (so the next attempt reconnects to every bonded LE device again) and can publish Pairing.Error for the old index after the new Programming state, so the step briefly shows \"Couldn\u0027t program the remote\".\n\nSuggest a try/catch that rethrows the cancellation:\n\n```\n_pairing.value \u003d\n    try {\n        programmers.withRemote(repository.remoteAddress) { remote, session -\u003e ... }\n        tone.start()\n        Pairing.Ready(index, count)\n    } catch (e: CancellationException) {\n        // Superseded by another attempt or by leaving the step: not a failure.\n        throw e\n    } catch (e: Exception) {\n        Log.e(TAG, \"Programming code set $index failed\", e)\n        repository.remoteAddress \u003d null\n        Pairing.Error(index, count, e.message ?: e.toString())\n    }\n```",
      "revId": "66c155cfea29a8bea6fa0e87ea527838a5a40454",
      "serverId": "1ec6b3db-b2c1-4fa4-84a2-4c7efe89ba71"
